<title>ECUADOR: Ecuador cocoa and cocoa products export prices.</title>
<headline>Ecuador cocoa and cocoa products export prices.</headline>
<dateline>QUITO 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Here is a list of minimum FOB reference prices for exporting 100-lb (45.36-kilo) sacks of Ecuadorean cocoa and cocoa products, effective Oct 17 to 23:</p>
<p>    Arriba Superior Epoca......................$ 59.75</p>
<p>    Arriba Superior Summer.....................$ 63.63</p>
<p>    Arriba Superior Summer Select..............$ 65.43</p>
<p>    Arriba Superior Summer Plantation Select...$ 68.71</p>
<p>    Cocoa butter...............................$161.76</p>
<p>    Residual butter............................$121.32</p>
<p>Unsweeten or bitter cocoa,</p>
<p>    Cocoa liquor or paste......................$ 85.73</p>
<p>    Cocoa cake.................................$ 21.73</p>
<p>    Residual natural cake......................$  2.17</p>
<p>    Cocoa powder...............................$ 24.12</p>
</text>
